      "text": "KARNATAKA STATE POLICE\n\nFIRST INFORMATION REPORT (Under Section 173 Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita)\n\nBefore the Honourable Court of C.J. (J.D) & JMFC, Chitapur,Gulbarga\n\n1. District : Kalaburagi Circle/Sub Division : Kalagi Circle PS : Madbool PS\n\nCrime No : 0056/2026 FIR Date : 07/06/2026\n\n2. Act & Section : THE BHARATIYA NYAYA SANHITA (BNS), 2023 (U/s-189(2),191(2),126(2),352,190)\n\n3. (a) Occurence of Offence Day : Saturday From Date : 06/06/2026 To Date : 06/06/2026 From Time : 20:40:00 To Time : 22:00:00 (b) Information received at the PS : 07/06/2026 01:00:00 Written/Oral : Written\n\n(c) Reasons for Delay in reporting by the Complainant / Informant\n\n(d) General Diary reference Entry No. & Time : 2 , 01:00:00\n\n4. (a) Place of occurence with full address Kalaburgi to Sedam Main Road Near Madbool Cross, Tq:Kalagi,Kalaburagi , Karnataka,\n\n(b) Distance from PS : Towards 02 KM East From PS (c) Village : MADBOOL Beat Name : BEAT NO 04\n\n(d) If the place belongs to another jurisdiction,PS. Name :\n\nDistrict : 5. Complainant/Informant: (a) Name : St.Com.Sri Ramesh CPC Father's/Husband's Name : 233 (b) Age : 36 (c) Occupation : Police officer (d) Religion : Hindu (e) Caste : LAMBAID (f) Fax : (g) Email : madboogba@ksp.gov.in\n\n(h) Phone No. : 7760203406 (i) Nationality : India\n\n(j) Passport No. : Date of Issue :\n\n(k) Address : Madbool Police (l) Sex: Male\n\nStation,Tq:Kalagi , Kalaburagi , Karnataka\n\n(m) Whether complainant has seen the occurence or merely heard of it : ಪರದರದ ಕತವನದನ ನಡದರದರ\n\n6. Details of known/suspected/unknown accused with full particulars(Attach separate sheet if necessary)\n\nName / Father Name / Type Person Type Sex Age Occupation Sl.No. Caste / Address\n\n1 Sunil So Shivaray Accused Common Male Hunchikar(A1) / ACHARI man ,Ingankal village,Tq:KalagiKalaburagi, Karnataka\n\n2 Rajashekhar Aliyas Raju S o Accused Adult Male Sharanappa Mangalagi(A2) ,Ingankal village,Tq:KalagiKalaburagi, Karnataka\n\n3 Ma